  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women and Girls FIRST II in Sierra Leone - CAFOD Operational Budget</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to improve financial inclusion and strengthen the resilience of rural communities&#x2019; livelihoods, particularly for women and girls in Sierra Leone. Specifically, the project will aim to achieve the following: 

1)	Financial empowerment of rural communities, through improved financial literacy and money management capacity and confidence, especially for women and girls 
2)	Rural communities, especially women, better able to access inclusive and needs driven formal financial products and services 
3)	Rural communities have sustainable and resilient livelihoods that conserve local biodiversity and contribute to diversified and gender-inclusive income at household and community level.</narrative>
  </description>
